Claim and run up to this many available jobs, then exit; expired leases are recovered

Usage: aws-inventory job run [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --queue <QUEUE>                  [default: jobs.sqlite]
      --limit <LIMIT>                  [default: 1]
      --lease-seconds <LEASE_SECONDS>  [default: 60]
      --worker <WORKER>                
  -h, --help                           Print help
